# PWA build output (regenerated by `bun run build` on every build).
#
# Scoped to the exact GENERATED naming schemes, never to a whole directory: the
# fingerprinted icons and public/icons/icons.gen.json are manually generated,
# committed provenance (`bun run gen:icons`) and must stay tracked. A successful
# build therefore leaves `git status` clean, which is what lets the next build's
# clean-source guard pass.
# NB: git has no trailing-comment syntax — a `# …` after a pattern is part of
# the pattern and silently matches nothing. Comments stay on their own lines.
#
# gen-pwa output (release-suffixed manifest variants)
public/manifest-*.*.json
# gen-pwa output (release-suffixed offline page)
public/offline.*.html
# postbuild-pwa output (precache list for one specific build)
sw/precache.gen.ts

# IntelliJ based IDEs
.idea

# Finder (MacOS) folder config
.DS_Store
